+
+/****************************************************************************
+ * Name: board_motor_initialize
+ *
+ * Description:
+ *   Initialize MCPWM peripheral for motor control and register the motor
+ *   driver.
+ *
+ * Input Parameters:
+ *   None.
+ *
+ * Returned Value:
+ *   Zero (OK) on success; a negated errno value on failure.
